            "review_title": "Review at Quán Ăn Cô Kòi",
            "review_text": "Discover31609707351\n3 contributions\n0\nA sidewalk restaurant that you should experience when coming to Hanoi\nApr 2025 • Family\nGrilled beef and udder (bò nầm nướng) is a flavorful and satisfying dish that brings out the best of smoky street food. The beef is tender, juicy, and well-marinated, while the udder adds a unique, creamy texture that melts in your mouth. Grilled over charcoal or on a cast iron pan, it delivers a rich aroma and a savory taste that pairs perfectly with fresh herbs and a spicy dipping sauce. A must-try for meat lovers who enjoy bold flavors and a bit of culinary adventure\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 29, 2025",
